// NativeCustomerServiceAgent - Tool Functions
// 
// With the native ai:McpToolKit approach, tool functions are discovered
// automatically from MCP servers. This file is intentionally empty.
//
// The ai:McpToolKit handles tool discovery, schema extraction, and execution.
//
// To add custom (non-MCP) tools, define them here as isolated functions
// annotated with @ai:AgentTool and add them to the agent tools list in main.bal.
